@url = {{SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1
@apikey = {{SERVICE_ROLE_KEY}}

### Upsert order to trigger status log + OneSignal webhook
POST {{url}}/rpc/orders_upsert
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Prefer: return=representation

{
  "p_store_id": "{{STORE_ID}}",
  "p_order": {
    "status": "Prepared",
    "customer": {"name": "Test Customer"},
    "total": "15.50"
  },
  "p_items": [
    {"name": "Fries", "quantity": 1, "price": "5.00"},
    {"name": "Burger", "quantity": 1, "price": "10.50"}
  ]
}

### Verify order events log
GET {{url}}/order_events?order_id=eq.{{ORDER_ID}}
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Prefer: count=exact



